'''Principal Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained by purchasing him from a special sale during the [[Heartbeat Catcademy]] event. He was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 735
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Principal Cat
|name2 = Midlife Crisis Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Midlife Crisis Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sadly, this Cat does a terrible job as a [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] variant. His stats are unreliable even at Level 30, so this Cat should not be even considered for serious usage outside of [[Empire of Cats]] and the restricted [[Heartbeat Catcademy]] stages, where he can greatly help against the Traitless, Red and Dark enemies without the need to farm Love Letters for his + levels like other Heartbeat Catcademy units. Like [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]], his stats increase exponentially past level 30, reaching 40,890 HP, 13,920 AP and 6,233 DPS at level 50, but by that point you will already have better units that can deal with the same enemy types better.

However, this Cat does not just serve as User Rank Dump and Love Letter Farmer—his main selling point is the Cat Combo [[Catcademy Anthem (Combo)|Catcademy Anthem]]. This is actually a very helpful Combo, decreasing the time between Cat deployment by a landslide. However, being a 5-slot Combo, its effect can easily be reproduced or surpassed by stacking other smaller Research UP Combos like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]], [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] and [[Mini-Saurus (Combo)|Mini-Saurus]], or certain other Combos like [[Bad Guys (Combo)|Bad Guys]].

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

