==Trivia==
*Principal Cat has the same hairstyle, hair color and suit as Kinpachi Sakamoto, the eponymous teacher from the television drama ''[[wikipedia:Kinpachi-sensei|Kinpachi-sensei]]'', also known as ''Mr. Kinpachi in Class 3B''.
*Principal Cat's Japanese description reads like a school's anthem.
*[[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]], Principal Cat and [[Choco Capsule (Special Cat)|Choco Capsule]] are currently the only cats to have level scaling above 20%.
*Principal Cat is currently the only [[:Category:IAP Cats|IAP Cat]] to have a Cat Combo featuring at least one other unit.

